<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>System and jurisdiction</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<hr/>
<p>version: 0.1.0 system_name: {{ system_name }} jurisdiction: {{ jurisdiction }} records_officer: {{ records_officer }} access_request_officer: {{ access_request_officer }} schedule_approved_on: {{ schedule_approved_on }} launch_date: {{ launch_date }}</p>
<hr/>
<h1>System and jurisdiction</h1>
<ul><li>system_name: {{ system_name }}</li><li>jurisdiction: {{ jurisdiction }} (us-federal | us-state | uk | eu | ca-federal | ca-provincial)</li><li>access_request_clock_working_days: &lt;20 for us-federal and uk; confirm otherwise&gt;</li></ul>
<h1>Retention schedule</h1>
<p>One row per record class (r-retention-schedule-per-record-class). Disposition is destroy or transfer-to-archives; never open-ended.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Record class</th><th>Retention period (ISO-8601)</th><th>Disposition</th><th>Schedule item</th><th>Stores</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;citizen submissions&gt;</td><td>P7Y</td><td>destroy</td><td>&lt;NARA GRS / agency / archives item&gt;</td><td>&lt;store names&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;audit logs&gt;</td><td>P3Y</td><td>destroy</td><td>&lt;item&gt;</td><td>&lt;store names&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Data stores and export paths</h1>
<p>One row per store (r-request-export-within-statutory-clock). Lead time must sit inside the clock or the store is a blocking finding.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Store</th><th>Export tool</th><th>Query</th><th>Owner (role:handle)</th><th>Lead time (working days)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;store&gt;</td><td>&lt;tool&gt;</td><td>&lt;query&gt;</td><td>role:&lt;handle&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Exemption map</h1>
<p>One row per withheld field (r-exempt-fields-tagged-in-schema). Manual-review rows carry a cost estimate.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>store.field</th><th>Category</th><th>Statutory basis</th><th>Redaction</th><th>Manual-review cost estimate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;store.field&gt;</td><td>personal-privacy</td><td>&lt;5 U.S.C. §552(b)(6) / UK FOIA s.40 / ...&gt;</td><td>field-driven</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Staff channels</h1>
<p>Every channel staff use for business about the system (r-ephemeral-channels-captured).</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Channel</th><th>Capture mechanism</th><th>Auto-delete</th><th>Non-official copy within days (us-federal, max 20)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;channel&gt;</td><td>&lt;mechanism into the system of record&gt;</td><td>false</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Accessibility audit plan</h1>
<ul><li>wcag_version: 2.1 | 2.2</li><li>level: AA</li><li>standard_reference: section-508 | en-301-549 | uk-psbar-2018 | aoda | other</li><li>launch_gate: no-critical-or-serious-failure</li><li>accessibility_statement_required: true | false</li><li>accessibility_statement_url: &lt;URL when required&gt;</li></ul>
<table><thead><tr><th>Flow</th><th>Automated tool</th><th>Manual tests</th><th>Remediation owner</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;public flow&gt;</td><td>&lt;axe-core / Lighthouse / ...&gt;</td><td>screen-reader, keyboard-only, zoom-200</td><td>role:&lt;handle&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Procurement clause review log</h1>
<p>One block per mandatory topic (r-procurement-clause-review-log): data_residency, security_authorisation, source_code_escrow_and_ip, open_source_licence, subcontractor_flow_down, accessibility_warranty, records_transfer_on_termination.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Topic</th><th>Clause id</th><th>Design decision</th><th>Status</th><th>Waived by</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>data_residency</td><td>&lt;clause id&gt;</td><td>&lt;decision it forces&gt;</td><td>met</td><td>—</td><td>&lt;URL&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Public notice</h1>
<ul><li>assessed: true</li><li>required: true | false</li><li>regime: pra | state-apa | uk-consultation | eu-consultation | other</li><li>buffer_days: &lt;at least 90 plus review time when required&gt;</li><li>notices_filed: &lt;60-day-federal-register YYYY-MM-DD; 30-day-federal-register YYYY-MM-DD; omb-submission YYYY-MM-DD&gt;</li><li>omb_control_number: &lt;NNNN-NNNN when issued&gt;</li></ul>
<h1>Officers</h1>
<ul><li>records_officer: {{ records_officer }}</li><li>access_request_officer: {{ access_request_officer }}</li><li>schedule_approved_on: {{ schedule_approved_on }}</li></ul>
<h1>Launch</h1>
<ul><li>launch_date: {{ launch_date }}</li></ul>
<h1>Blocking findings</h1>
<ul><li>&lt;store past the clock, untagged exempt field, open clause, unscheduled notice period; or &quot;none&quot;&gt;</li></ul>
</body></html>
